# Formello tokens

Reuse `:root` variables; do not hardcode colors outside tokens.

Canonical colors: `--bg`, `--text`, `--text-muted`, `--accent`, `--cta-fill`, `--cta-border`, `--cta-glow`. Layout: `--container` (1200px), `--pad-x`. Desktop frame ~1440.

Typography utilities: `.type-h1` … `.type-h5`, `.type-body`, `.type-btn`. Do **not** add font-weight 500 or 700.

New cards, inputs, dialogs must match dark navy + cyan CTA border/glow.

Exceptions (not in type scale): `.logo__tag`, `.field__error`, `.mission__num`. Request modal chrome stays compact (smaller title/lead/inputs than page scale).

